  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">INNOVATIVE YOUNG SCIENTISTS KENYA CO.LTD</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">YSK&#x2019;s mission is to inspire and empower the next generation of young scientists, innovators, and entrepreneurs to transform their local and global communities through STEM. YSK&#x2019;s strategy, &#x201c;Leave No Learner Behind&#x201d; focuses on 1) supporting students with access to learning materials 2) supporting schools with the provision of STEM mobile laboratories and 3) supporting teachers&#x2019; skills development. Specifically, in 2025, funding from the Embassy supports 1) STEM outreach activities 2) STEM bootcamp activities 3) the National Exhibition 4) a trip for the 2025 National Delegation winners to visit the BTYSTE in Ireland in January 2026 .The additional funding of &#x20ac;38,500 supported funding shortfalls for the organisation and the annual licensing fee to YSTE.</narrative>
  </description>
